  "Question": "The product \\((1.8)(40.3 + 0.07)\\) is closest to",
  "Question Type": "text",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "\\(7\\)",
    "B": "\\(42\\)",
    "C": "\\(74\\)",
    "D": "\\(84\\)",
    "E": "\\(737\\)"
  },
  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Correct Answer": "C",
  "Solution": "Evaluate the parentheses first, then multiply:\n\\[\n1.8(40.3+0.07)=1.8(40.37)=72.666.\n\\]\nThe choices immediately below and above this value are \\(42\\) and \\(74\\), so only these can be closest. Their distances from the product are\n\\[\n72.666-42=30.666,\n\\qquad\n74-72.666=1.334.\n\\]\nTherefore the product is closest to \\(\\boxed{74}\\), choice \\(\\boxed{\\text{C}}\\).",
